# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
build/

**/node_modules/*
**/ios/.symlinks
# NOTE: example/macos/ is intentionally NOT ignored — its scaffolding is already
# checked in, and ignoring a tracked path makes `dart pub publish` warn. The
# macOS files are kept out of the published tarball via .pubignore instead.

# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/
